          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300">
            Examine the operational reality of traditional receptionist setups compared to our synchronized omnichannel AI infrastructure.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
          
          <!-- Red Card: The Costly Old Way -->
          <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-950/70 border border-rose-500/25 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div class="space-y-6">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-rose-500/20 pb-4">
                <div>
                  <span class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase text-rose-400 tracking-wider">Status Quo</span>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-1">The Costly Old Way</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-400 flex items-center justify-center border border-rose-500/30">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line></svg>
                </div>
              </div>

              <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-300">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                  <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-rose-500/20 text-rose-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line></svg>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <strong class="text-white">Inquiries sit unanswered after 5:00 PM and all weekend:</strong> High-ticket prospects browse during evenings and Sundays when front desks are closed.
                  </div>
                </li>

                <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                  <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-rose-500/20 text-rose-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line></svg>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <strong class="text-white">Prospects bounce to competitors within 8 minutes of waiting:</strong> 78% of local clients buy from the practice that replies first. Delayed responses kill conversion.
                  </div>
                </li>

                <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                  <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-rose-500/20 text-rose-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line></svg>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <strong class="text-white">Front desk staff drowns in repetitive FAQs instead of attending to in-person guests:</strong> Staff spends 4+ hours daily answering "how much is consultation" instead of attending to clinic visitors.
                  </div>
                </li>

                <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                  <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-rose-500/20 text-rose-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line></svg>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <strong class="text-white">High no-show rates due to absent follow-up reminders:</strong> Inadequate or absent follow-up sequences lead to empty treatment chairs and wasted clinical hours.
